# ── Private layer: your fleet, never shipped ────────────────────────────────
# Each of these has a tracked .example seed. Copy the seeds on first run:
#   for f in FLEET STATUS TODOS CHANGELOG; do cp $f.example.md $f.md; done
#   cp clients/REGISTRY.example.md clients/REGISTRY.md
FLEET.md
STATUS.md
TODOS.md
CHANGELOG.md
dev/architecture.html

# Client records — the example record stays public, real clients never do
clients/*.md
!clients/_example-client.md
!clients/REGISTRY.example.md
